    "detailed_description": "The rise and fall of civilizations, in the span of a click.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to &quot;Civilization Simulator&quot; - a simple yet deep casual game. Every click you make will determine the fate of a civilization.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRandom event-driven: From thriving trade to sudden disasters, each click may bring unexpected events.<br />\r\nEasy operation: Click the &quot;Auto Play&quot; button, and the game will run automatically.<br />\r\nCasual development: Civilization evolution can earn you coins, and victory yields a significant amount of coins to be spent on bonuses in the store.<br />\r\nDeep narrative: Despite the straightforward gameplay, each event holds a profound background story, presenting you with a grand epic of civilization.<br />\r\nSimple interface: A clean interface allows you to immerse yourself in the evolution of civilization.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn &quot;Civilization Simulator,&quot; every click is a historical choice. Now, let's embark on this unforgettable journey through history and see where your civilization will lead!",
    "about_the_game": "The rise and fall of civilizations, in the span of a click.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to &quot;Civilization Simulator&quot; - a simple yet deep casual game. Every click you make will determine the fate of a civilization.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRandom event-driven: From thriving trade to sudden disasters, each click may bring unexpected events.<br />\r\nEasy operation: Click the &quot;Auto Play&quot; button, and the game will run automatically.<br />\r\nCasual development: Civilization evolution can earn you coins, and victory yields a significant amount of coins to be spent on bonuses in the store.<br />\r\nDeep narrative: Despite the straightforward gameplay, each event holds a profound background story, presenting you with a grand epic of civilization.<br />\r\nSimple interface: A clean interface allows you to immerse yourself in the evolution of civilization.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn &quot;Civilization Simulator,&quot; every click is a historical choice. Now, let's embark on this unforgettable journey through history and see where your civilization will lead!",
    "short_description": "&quot;Civilization Simulator&quot;: A casual simulation game that lets you control the fate of civilizations. Every click will impact the course of civilization. Whether it's prosperous trade or unexpected disasters, each turn presents a brand new challenge!",
